## Section One

This is a plain paragraph with **bold** and *italic* text. Also test ~~strikethrough~~ and **bold with *nested italic* text**.

@1 First numbered item
@@a Nested alpha item
@@b Another alpha item
@2 Second numbered item

@- Bullet point one
@@- Nested bullet
@- Bullet point two

@style(align: center)
  Centered paragraph

@style(align: right)
  Right-aligned paragraph

@bold This text is bold via modifier

@italic This is styled as italic via modifier

@table
  @row
    @cell: Header A
    @cell: Header B
    @cell: Header C
  @row
    @cell: Value 1
    @cell: Value 2
    @cell: Value 3
  @row
    @cell: Cell A
    @cell: Cell B
    @cell: Cell C

